      "id": 30822,
      "name": "Lapis",
      "slug": "lapis",
      "batch": "Fall 2025",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/lapis",
      "changed_fields": [
        "long_description",
        "small_logo_thumb_url"
      ],
      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Lapis gives businesses the ability to run end-end ads on AI platforms, starting with ChatGPT Ads. With Lapis, businesses can rapidly iterate on ad copies and A/B test at scale without being bottlenecked by design and creative capacity.\r\n\r\nLapis can also be used on traditional ad platforms like Google and Meta, where marketers can use Lapis to generate ad creatives, headlines, and get feedback on what ads actually work.\r\n\r\nLapis is used by 1,000+ marketing teams, from big businesses like Hyundai and Tata to small businesses around the world, and supports 15+ languages including English, Spanish, and Italian.",
          "after": "Lapis builds, launches, and scales paid ad campaigns for DTC and SaaS businesses.\r\n\r\nLapis agents handle every step of the paid ads journey: writing ad copy (headlines and descriptions), generating the static images used in ads, deploying campaigns across paid channels, creating a custom landing page for each ad, and feeding real user interaction data back into a self-improving ads engine that gets better every day.\r\n\r\nWith Lapis, businesses can rapidly iterate on ads and A/B test at scale, free from the human design and creative bottlenecks that slow teams down. Using Lapis, companies can quantitatively improve their paid ads performance by up to 20x.\r\n\r\nLapis is used by 1,500+ marketing teams and 30+ enterprises, from Fortune 500 businesses to fast growing DTC businesses, and supports 10 languages including English, Spanish, and Italian."
        },
        "small_logo_thumb_url": {
          "before": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/9c3bc6a804835cf4e60592673af66342d45aa417.png",
